!THIS IS THE USER GUIDE!
In order to use the tool you have to add it in your part studio clicking Add Custom Features, or by copy pasting the script in the feature studio.
After adding it you have to select it from the custom features in your part studio.
Then you can customize the parameters of the screw changing the input values and by clicking the green button your screw is now ready as a SOLID part.

Thats all !!!
